"It helps to picture qi as a single team that yin and yang split between them. Yang qi handles warming and moving; yin qi handles moistening and calming. Plain qi deficiency is a general shortage of staff. Yang deficiency and yin deficiency describe which side of the team is short-staffed. A person can, in theory, have signs of both at once, which is simply qi deficiency that has not yet settled clearly into one direction.": "e133db8654d2",
